<div class="content-box" style="background: #fff3cd; border-left: 4px solid #ffc107;">
    <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-lightbulb"></i> Watch Out For</h2>
    <p>Common misconceptions to avoid:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Neural Network "Understanding": Assuming ANNs understand concepts like humans do, rather than performing complex non-linear regressions.</li>
        <li>Mutation in GA: Viewing mutation as "bad"; students must see it as a vital mechanism for maintaining genetic diversity and preventing local optima.</li>
    </ul>
